    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that there were some conflicts, but it feels like most of those \"downsides\" were just corporations trying to avoid paying fair wages and giving workers rights. do you think the arguments against unions were actually valid, or was it mostly just an excuse to protect corporate profits at the expense of democracy?",
